## Original Content
Le conflit au Soudan déborde de nouveau au Tchad. L'armée tchadienne affirme que des aéronefs et des drones liés aux belligérants soudanais ont poursuivi et bombardé une colonne de véhicules jusque sur le territoire tchadien. La correspondance à Ndjamena de Ghislaine Allahtaroum.

## Summary
The conflict in Sudan has spilled over into Chad, with the Chadian army accusing Sudanese-linked forces of violating their territory by bombing a vehicle column within Chadian borders. This incident marks another territorial violation amid escalating regional tensions.

## Key Points
- The Sudanese conflict is crossing into neighboring Chad.
- Chadian territory was violated by military aircraft and drones linked to Sudanese belligerents.
- A column of vehicles within Chadian borders was targeted and bombed.
- This event highlights the risk of further regional escalation.


